A||||4||jhar1987||t-converter question||||1||
Z||000000||jhar1987||04-20-2001||07:02 PM||||my v-6 auto the past couple of days has had a problem. this doesn't happen all the time either. you come up to a stop and the car bucks back and forth and dies hard, i mean if you have ever broke a clutch cable and had to stop the car in high gear it has that "THUNK" and it dies,stops right now. the car will restart in park then sometimes its fine other times you have to baby her till she gets going again. thats the only way to discribe it. what do ya think? thanks jeff||||reg||1
Z||000001||SteveJ||04-20-2001||08:45 PM||||Not the converter but the converter lockup solenoid, TCC. Unplug the conecter to disable it until you can get it fixed. Its a four prong electrical connector on the firewall side of the trans near the top of the trans. It runs in horizontally from the firewall side toward the back.(sometimes its green) Lots of information is available on this problem. Try the ogre's cave at the bottom of this page to start with and a search on TCC.<BR><p>[This message has been edited by SteveJ (edited 04-20-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000002||jhar1987||04-20-2001||09:01 PM||||thanks steve, where is the plug located?thanks jeff||||reg||1
Z||000003||SteveJ||04-20-2001||09:11 PM||||Gee I did my best in the last post to describe it. <BR>Standing in back of the car. Look down in the engine compartment. Transmission sticks out toward the left and has an aluminum end cover. Looking just to the right of where that cover attaches and on the firewall side you should see an electrical connector pluged into the trans. That's it. Unplug it and tuck it where it won't come to any harm.<P>Cars can run without this for extended periods so don't worry. Run a search on this there have been a lot of posts, some in the last few days, some with pictures.<BR> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/009703.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/009703.html</A> <p>[This message has been edited by SteveJ (edited 04-20-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000004||SteveJ||04-20-2001||09:20 PM|||| <A HREF="http://www.kichline.com/chuck/fiero/TCC.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.kichline.com/chuck/fiero/TCC.htm</A>  <A HREF="http://www.franken.de/users/dagobah/luke/tcc.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.franken.de/users/dagobah/luke/tcc.html</A>  <P>Pictures included!||||reg||1
